      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm currently drafting a section for my thesis on the Maillard reaction. Could you provide a detailed breakdown of the specific roles that amino acids and reducing sugars play in the initial stages of the reaction? I'm particularly interested in the nucleophilic attack mechanism, and I'd also like to know how varying the pH levels of the environment influences the overall rate of browning in proteins.",
